# 仅供独立产品 profile 启动前参考；项目不会自动加载 .env 文件。
# Reference for launching a standalone product profile. The project does not load .env automatically.
# 请在 PowerShell 或受管进程环境中设置需要覆盖的变量；不要提交真实 .env。
# Set overrides in PowerShell or the managed process environment. Never commit a real .env file.

# 产品数据根目录；留空使用当前工作目录下的 .runtime/bot-data。
# Product data root; defaults to .runtime/bot-data under the current working directory.
BOT_HOME=
# 工作区根目录；留空使用当前工作目录下的 .runtime/workspaces，首次安装后记录到 workspace.json。
# Workspace root; defaults to .runtime/workspaces under the current directory and is recorded in workspace.json on installation.
BOT_WORKSPACE_ROOT=
# 媒体 worker 的 Python 3.12/3.13 解释器；留空使用安装器创建的媒体环境。
# Python 3.12/3.13 interpreter for media workers; defaults to the media environment created by the installer.
BOT_PYTHON=

# 图片协议、地址、模型、密钥变量名和 ComfyUI 工作流在服务面板配置。
# Configure image protocol, endpoint, model, key variable name and ComfyUI workflow in the Services panel.
# 密钥变量默认 OPENAI_API_KEY，也可在服务面板指定其他变量；请安全注入，不要在此填写密钥。
# The key variable defaults to OPENAI_API_KEY and can be changed in the Services panel; inject secrets securely, never put them here.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# 媒体分析密钥由 Harness credentials 注入到短生命周期 worker；不要在此填写。
# Harness credentials inject media analysis keys into short-lived workers. Do not put them here.
# BOT_ANALYSIS_API_KEY=

# 音色模型库根目录；留空后在面板“服务”中配置。
# Voice model library root; leave blank to configure it on the Services page.
BOT_VOICE_MODELS_ROOT=<absolute-voice-model-root>
# Breeze-TTS-2.cpp HTTP 服务地址；留空使用面板默认地址。
# Breeze-TTS-2.cpp HTTP service URL; leave blank to use the panel default.
BREEZE_TTS_URL=<breeze-tts-http-url>
# 可选外部项目目录；只在面板点击对应启动按钮时使用固定启动器。
# Optional external project directories, used by fixed launchers only when their Start buttons are clicked.
GPT_SOVITS_ROOT=<gpt-sovits-project-root>
BREEZE_TTS_ROOT=<breeze-tts-project-root>
BREEZE_TTS_VOICES_ROOT=<breeze-tts-voices-directory>

# 可选安装层（仅 scripts/install.mjs；默认 core,basic-media）。
# Optional installation tiers (scripts/install.mjs only; default: core,basic-media).
BOT_INSTALL_LAYERS=core,basic-media

# 不要手工设置：启动器每次生成随机 IPC nonce。
# Do not set manually: the launcher generates a random IPC nonce each time.
# BOT_LAUNCH_TOKEN=
